# SHA-256 of the prebuilt frameworks committed under addons/godot-iap/bin/
# and the Android archives committed under addons/godot-iap/android/.
# CI builds the frameworks in job `apple-frameworks` in ci-godot-iap.yml
# and uploads them as an artifact; the maintainer commits that artifact.
# `bun run audit:godot-binaries` verifies the committed files against this
# manifest — the release runs it as a deploy gate
# (release-godot.yml validate-ios) and CI re-runs it on main/next pushes and
# PRs to fail earlier. macOS digests pin pre-signing bytes: notarized
# releases re-sign those frameworks before zipping, so shipped macOS bytes
# differ by design.
#
# Regenerate after an intentional rebuild:
#   node scripts/audit-godot-binary-digests.mjs --write
47d57de032a7dba637d07c37c66c231bb2e3eea461e1cea6953a49b506871d4d  addons/godot-iap/android/GodotIap.debug.aar
0182016eddc79e73f3c30161711bd553d82d5b89bdbdbdd188dc5dbc3a9bd612  addons/godot-iap/android/GodotIap.release.aar
90f72299b5c2c47302c2bfdedb7842d87b3e28893f4e2925456d8dac3edf9cb5  addons/godot-iap/bin/ios/GodotIap.framework/GodotIap
335242be996a2d7055ab680fd2489963a5099c713c320708e0e8c9435cba950c  addons/godot-iap/bin/ios/SwiftGodotRuntime.framework/SwiftGodotRuntime
1060f0028581efaaaf084a95e9893e026bbae7996cca5927fc4f57ce7d490926  addons/godot-iap/bin/macos/GodotIap.framework/GodotIap
cd720e0626842b8943eddd6df9f60dafb3d172624179229d54abe3cf8787b432  addons/godot-iap/bin/macos/SwiftGodotRuntime.framework/SwiftGodotRuntime
